      <floats-group id="article-22287.s16">
        <fig id="article-22287.image.f1" position="float" orientation="portrait">
          <caption>
            <p>Histopathology Showing Poststreptococcal Glomerulonephritis. Kidney biopsy from a 10-year-old boy admitted with acute kidney injury, proteinuria, hypertension, and nephritic urine sediment. (i) Light microscopy demonstrates diffuse endocapillary proliferation, prominent neutrophilic infiltration, lobular accentuation of the glomeruli, and a cellular crescent;&#x000a0;(ii) immunofluorescence reveals a classic granular &#x0201c;starry-sky&#x0201d; pattern of IgG and C3 deposits along the glomerular capillary walls and mesangium; and (iii) electron microscopy shows large subepithelial hump-like electron-dense deposits, consistent with poststreptococcal glomerulonephritis. Contributed by Prakash Gudsoorkar, MD</p>
          </caption>
          <graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="Post__Streptococcal__1" position="float" orientation="portrait"/>
        </fig>
      </floats-group>
      <floats-group id="article-22287.s17">
        <fig id="article-22287.image.f2" position="float" orientation="portrait">
          <caption>
            <p>Histopathology Showing Staphylococcal Infection-Associated Glomerulonephritis. Kidney biopsy from a 70-year-old woman with uncontrolled type 2 diabetes and a chronic nonhealing foot ulcer who presented with anasarca, hypertension, acute kidney injury, proteinuria, and nephritic urine sediment. (i) Light microscopy shows endocapillary and mesangial hypercellularity, mesangial expansion, and neutrophilic infiltration; (ii&#x02013;iii) immunofluorescence demonstrates granular C3 and IgA deposition within the mesangium and along the capillary walls; and (iv) electron microscopy reveals mesangial and subepithelial electron-dense deposits, confirming immune complex&#x02013;mediated glomerulonephritis related to staphylococcal infection. Contributed by Prakash Gudsoorkar, MD.</p>
          </caption>
          <graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="Screenshot__2025-10-17__at__1.11.00xPM" position="float" orientation="portrait"/>
        </fig>
      </floats-group>
